# .github/

# MongoDB VS Code extension scratch playgrounds. These are personal scratch
# files and they hold whatever you last pasted into them - including, easily, a
# connection string. A real seeding script belongs in the repo under a name that
# is not "playground".
*.mongodb.js
playground-*.mongodb

